@host = http://localhost:5080

### Session info (200 with authenticated:false when signed out)
GET {{host}}/api/me
Accept: application/json

### Health probe
GET {{host}}/health

### Steam sign-in — open in a BROWSER, not here (it redirects to Steam)
# {{host}}/auth/steam/login

### The signed-in user's library (401 without a session cookie)
GET {{host}}/api/library
Accept: application/json

###
